[{"id":166757863,"discussion_id":"44153e401f5d0617b9f3dd92245be6affd20ae17","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n lihang_13123, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-28T18:13:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-30T14:52:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166757895,"discussion_id":"f7a2d9a000f1ead18b56a2e11dd7d1ac4a07efaf","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-28T18:13:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T18:13:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166758039,"discussion_id":"d5f54be6d91d79c52858ed65dade37277a8cb43c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要修复了ScatterAdd算子中的两个关键问题。首先，修正了判断更新值（updates）是否为标量的逻辑，原逻辑无法正确识别形状为`[1]`的单元素一维张量，可能导致后续tiling计算或内核执行路径选择错误。其次，在算子的SIMD支持原子加内核中，为标量更新的处理路径添加了硬件事件同步机制，解决了MTE2到S的数据传输可能存在的时序竞争问题，确保了原子加操作的执行顺序和数据一致性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改主要包含两部分。一是在`GetShapeAttrsInfo`函数中，将判断`isUpdateScalar_`标志的逻辑从单一的`updateDims == 0`扩展为`(updateDims == 1 && updatesSize_ == 1) || updateDims == 0`，从而正确覆盖零维张量及单元素一维张量这两种标量场景。二是在`ScatterAddSIMDSupportAtomicAdd`内核的`ProcessAtomicAdd`函数中，当处理标量更新时，显式地获取、设置并等待一个`MTE2_S`类型的硬件事件，确保所有相关数据传输在原子加操作前完成，避免了潜在的读写冲突。","created_at":"2026-03-28T18:14:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T18:14:16+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166758329,"discussion_id":"26f622c52161c127c250c56797fcc96f3c7624a5","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-28T18:16:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T18:16:02+08:00","user":{"id":"68338ab4cfaee65d71be80c1","login":"lihang_13123","object_id":"68338ab4cfaee65d71be80c1","name":"lihang_13123","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lihang_13123"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166758347,"discussion_id":"38357e54158bedf2779832d53e69e61848a6a0df","body":"compile#blue_sc","created_at":"2026-03-28T18:16:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T18:16:11+08:00","user":{"id":"68338ab4cfaee65d71be80c1","login":"lihang_13123","object_id":"68338ab